{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:603dc51ea5fcabdc918a767be060babb0d55fdb3cd63e6654224f9829c9292a3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3e93ff46c21177317695f17de970d054fa75d601c529c3fc263600d9ae66fe",
      "text": "爱马之人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc12007dc3dc55c582225e2d57bf679b55480ebe3835dbd5c8561c854b09d92e",
      "text": "丽和制作人为了看马而来到了赛马场。\n丽在亮相圈对着马儿侃侃而谈，展现出爱马的一面。\n两人预测了哪匹马会获胜后，\n便向看台走去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3e93ff46c21177317695f17de970d054fa75d601c529c3fc263600d9ae66fe",
      "text": "爱马之人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74607743e757a8fb19791ac23d7f598b2980fccd29d1092bece1f3edbffb580c",
      "text": "赛马场·跑道",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a0b54fbd47786930b09200b6b8c2095283b31d2f50796f7304740116158c4ad",
      "text": "今天请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2139c431fdb06ad5433f5a360895ac53435896b6e6337d92c5414db0c32fc0b6",
      "text": "哪里，我才要请您多指教。\n今天非常感谢您的邀请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8d59b2504fd0e507a8a4c4ab6443a237b5b32723423631a0acdd343a7ca1979",
      "text": "不用言谢。倒是我才该感谢你，\n你能接受我的邀请让我很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54adb6254c4cef70478399adde14ce3298eddc9e51e905dfbdfef6ce4917307b",
      "text": "我在事务所看赛马比赛，\n真是看对了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30e74a839c69c8f62a1841c816cf5b935acfbf6c838cad53c53d1939ec8a17f8",
      "text": "难得看到丽先生在音乐之外展现出如此热衷的模样，\n我忍不住就向您搭话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f92c1c53b69c1cd80b0cf1c57631dbca1078fbaf3af562f9f5798d6e558f6a",
      "text": "看了比赛后，我非常理解您投入热情的心情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c34b9c28a6bcda20c71c13597d134cb7049a2d9c298c84c8f838d928f94eb5e",
      "text": "嗯。奔跑时充满力量的步伐，\n富有跃动感的肌肉线条……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7579f25859a85b3b2b0e825325345332a42c9408c4bc39e11de1db0a6ace9051",
      "text": "它的魅力真是说也说不尽。希望通过近距离观察马匹，\n能让你哪怕稍微感受一下它的美妙之处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cecb0bf52c7bbedcca6bc39ad060b5ef0e5be818de69ad0cc2bb1c42db7bfaa",
      "text": "好的！我很期待。话说回来，\n人可真多啊。感觉都要被这股热气吞没了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee1210447f34f998cd20929b85c3340b166a1ea03ac8d0706e21b9ae148b6511",
      "text": "是啊。今天有重赏赛事。\n或许观战的观众们也是干劲十足吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d77b1032857ca4e6b7acfa6c269cce4954cb828db496dc698a30bce6bb68b6a",
      "text": "首先去亮相圈吧。今天出战主赛事的\n马匹差不多应该在那边了。这边请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3695c52c2e5f8ceb00d967b80dc29eb223dfdef4abe7cf4be7bc9ffd97f0f9b6",
      "text": "赛马场·亮相圈",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:499998b3a1ed805ef3e8ef9c75b2080d220af7baadd5ef4da846602b661178e4",
      "text": "这里的气氛也很热烈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb7dc10552ecb432059820fa379f31d45a59aa28224765d7fb80e2cd60f7ece",
      "text": "因为大家都是来确认出场马匹的状态的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0322a3e1412449d429359ce1eefc64d29624cf08cb7a508fea698ebb799fad80",
      "text": "身体状况、毛色光泽、专注度以及后肢步伐……\n赛前需要观察的地方有很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4560302358a91b27222997a9c4bcd8a3b515ad0ebd62ae7b4984eee5e856f083",
      "text": "虽然我并不赌马，\n但马匹在这里的状态也会直接影响到赔率。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18441a8a27eb44cd1b92eb91550fe6962d42a7677c9dbb5fba3678b29fd83c2c",
      "text": "像这样看着，确实能体会到\n每匹马的状态都不一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea093ab67d853a92a08d576e004865f2c555a4659184a98c2f602b36f2b11242",
      "text": "没错……那匹马的步态很流畅。\n这边的这匹马，体态平衡比上次更好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:159b181d90f2c2b97d06a315dc1150b8b3baf49edde551ef18e9722ecdf91c2e",
      "text": "每一匹都真是美丽啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6067e056f64eb48ff953a1b939b9c4b9b5ce0eb161e6d79702673635adc2190",
      "text": "（丽先生正一脸开心地看着呢。\n能深切感受到他真的很喜欢马）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00e1bceb9fe247996c593d93975ce4bd4c5745a06ec9ab54740bcdb4b4ba9310",
      "text": "丽先生觉得在这之中，哪匹马会赢呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d14daa6ac5a2b512fa39ed84fbdc2884d360b6626e23166be16da69a6c59dbf8",
      "text": "让我想想。我觉得……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a98bcc697403edd9cc2a82bbac56da89a53adc545bd8673b7c95e085e0b31bdc",
      "text": "我觉得……3号的无限梦想，\n还有15号的弦乐二重奏会获胜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae40b715b82cbbc719d55a134a5a055326967622c891cb60d7228b2dc351e850",
      "text": "原来如此。两匹马的毛色都很好呢。\n而且看起来也非常专注。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcac614787a132629a9dcfba53f8348394a60c789d614f14110cfdec7765dd2",
      "text": "正如阁下所说。不仅如此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb30f2e4ab6db6cad6dcf831ffd4dfdedcb66c1e8e4220e26411707a86e16bd",
      "text": "两匹马的战绩一直都很稳健。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13b74d5eea6cb2ab2ceb34123f20737d5acb7f8d6f03ae1ebe9b1313f81ca968",
      "text": "是它们擅长的距离，场地状态也很优良。\n其中之一夺得第一名的可能性最高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d96e240b92c5539fdb72f44096db5b42f8bf225f4a81dbb3e5f74b929e3963",
      "text": "原来如此……3号和15号……啊，\n正好和315 Production是同一个数字呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1bc90084c571101e1f8869ef685f86f9420f672b411880d0a2b255e16d5f181",
      "text": "原来如此……经你这么一说，确实是呢。\n我之前都没注意到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c06d09394264c34d7f192674dcbaade50e468876d554a4b80be39a5d075620",
      "text": "虽说不是谐音梗，\n但这样一来无论如何都希望这两匹马能获胜了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d05fde66dfa2d5949701abe8c18c2d74c6138c81e95bb1c27b358352ea497c69",
      "text": "当然，所有马匹能平安完赛才是第一位的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d93aaf02d32b4fa5cf512953828a6d257c24693e3b0a6f2fa515f9b33b80814",
      "text": "是的呢。希望所有马匹都不会受伤，\n顺利结束比赛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5ce1f68098aba76fffb6b8b6b291dc49901e7c25e5d856a11b4f6ae106f05f",
      "text": "走吧，为了瞻仰那两匹马的英姿，我们回看台去吧。\n现在的话应该还能占个好位置。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fc4c431e5127e42089bf73ea4beb829939c930f489142fd43b8b0498434448",
      "text": "好了，比赛终于进入尾声！\n冲过最后的弯道，领跑的是9号！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6200d78e6d60237b41e0fa91245efeeecb5b4a20b5fa0f1a71cff4b848f8f53a",
      "text": "（丽先生预测的两匹马还在后方。\n接下来会怎么样呢……真紧张啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56e644e2d09bb4801ca03c2617f1d079943493699aac3f84b1edbff902e4d33",
      "text": "……啊，丽先生，冲上来了！无限梦想和\n弦乐二重奏追上来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:639bf54e122f6581f840c8ffd4816bae022882cfd7b669f22f12527b4f6ab1d2",
      "text": "嗯。两匹马的奔跑都充满力量！\n不断超越周围的马匹……简直如同一阵风啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b986835d15ccdeaad61d99c44a9882cefd97f0152be33c656b8c069faa0baabd",
      "text": "（在终点线前激烈争夺……！真没想到\n能看到如此热烈的较量）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e697be2725233bac6f6f6cac5dc5acc5233776b0c005e664d7f1e67350c8d0e",
      "text": "（在草地上奋力驰骋的光芒。\n让人移不开视线的疾驰绝非人力所能及……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b20be2743db0a4d400cca69917340ef4b88d995bcd6021f35fa36fb00c3708b",
      "text": "3号、15号，同时冲线！这可……\n很难判定呢。将进行终点摄影判定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23d9a342ebf848b8006a3d649574eeea1acc896cd31403ceff1f222d170ce56f",
      "text": "到底是哪边赢了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb907dc29442b3e138a23794efd722e986cac3030c417e21807c87c6f595514",
      "text": "不得而知啊。唯一可以确定的是双方都拼尽了全力。\n现在，静候判定结果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d9542b3b37dc28aa8646419ef67ef74fd479df9d638cc591ff403671f1bca9a",
      "text": "……结果出来了！经判定，无限梦想、\n弦乐二重奏……并列第1名！并列第1名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9e4ff3b9afc6053b58ccbe659af1902e60d0ec9ee15ae944ee98298791143b",
      "text": "太厉害了，\n丽先生的预测完全说中了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2987a41f6fcc20a688135f57dab13c05793b87b306c361bdc63869512b955e71",
      "text": "嗯。以它们的实力，这个结果理所应当。恭喜你们，\n无限梦想、弦乐二重奏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcd366ab763771473e0221babc75a197f1308c9c9f530d7ec920c2024b2ea745",
      "text": "今天看到了一场精彩的比赛啊。难得一见的胶着战局……\n而且，两匹马在最后的冲刺都极其出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fee8dca11c047afce80672a7357af6b1b155cd6a5ccd21dd976e11283354965",
      "text": "回想起从最后弯道进入直道时的光景，\n现在心头依然一片温热。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51480e8f2e4b26f7d62d229dbc55e62a9d0edc5a661847bce96c0e699188e1bb",
      "text": "我也是和丽先生一样的心情。\n不知道谁会赢，真的超级紧张激动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24d620cd83835da97cc1b77f05bdc555000c02e63e6a7c3d5043b91fd501dbd",
      "text": "最重要的是，看着真的很开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56864b38cefa1143cdbc1b6201413f6c64c08cf98bee0701e216da37a324fa9",
      "text": "能听到你这么说真是再好不过了。看着阁下高兴的表情，\n连我自己都觉得开心起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca244a3fb748145fff98c9c7b5e35cd32288035d822e93a403e8a87cfd9034e0",
      "text": "……和别人一起来赛马场也很不错呢。\n一个人细细品味感动固然不坏，但……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6aa4396cb7550327b922e3bd6946f8f0cb5008ca4090a036905175f31b06dac",
      "text": "有人能够分享今天所见的景象、分担忧喜的心情，\n感动便仿佛放大了数倍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:196a1af962e30a64104f0d2928c6a6bc57dcca8aed6bc33f355d622bfbc56546",
      "text": "要是不介意的话，下次再一起去赛马……不，去看马\n好吗？骑马俱乐部里也有很多极其出色的马。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe9f4f6907db369c952620fc3526b33bdf1452311a02fd0cc014053272fef95",
      "text": "好啊，请务必！下次也请邀请我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4724741187f65465f32dc78bf79c91130c22c381e5b88720c104445a391a2d1",
      "text": "我明白了。到时候我会叫你的。\n今天很开心。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
